  "finding": "This F provider implements CPU address semantics, not product lifecycle. It already calls original CPU40 selector_outside_GDT_LDT/read_descriptor_linear; it cannot move to B while still depending on C. A cohesive C owner must be evaluated in S14, with mirror diff approval if required. No per-caller real-mode shortcut, duplicate page walker, or added callback introduced.",
